  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NextGenMen PROGRAMME - 01/03/2025 TO 28/02/2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NxtGenMen project in South Africa, implemented by the School of Hard Knocks (SoHK), aims to contribute to bringing about change in attitudes towards gender and masculinity. The objective of the grant is to promote positive masculinity and improve mental health amongst men in South Africa for men and boys in the Province of Western Cape and Gauteng. The key activities include direct delivery of NxtGenMen (NGM) programmes (NGM workshops: traditional and lite) by the SoHK; train the trainer workshops for SoHK partner organisations delivered in partnership SOHK partner organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
